{"publicId":"1e989452-6dc0-4bbf-a40a-3a08e03c4e10","title":"PepGen发布FREEDOM2最低剂量组安全及vHOT中和数据","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T23:43:33.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-13T23:43:33.000Z","digest":"PepGen Inc. (PEPG) 通过发布FREEDOM2最低剂量组临床数据幻灯片，确认该组未出现严重安全性问题，剪接异常率低于预期目标（未披露具体数值），并首次公开vHOT（病毒热原体）中和数据（未披露中和效率）。\n\n研究旨在评估新型抗病毒药物PGN-EDODM1在HIV感染中的疗效，最低剂量组为关键观察指标。幻灯片内容与2026年11月10日电话会议披露信息一致，但补充了vHOT实验方法（基于公开材料推断为体外中和实验）。\n\n公司表示将根据后续数据推进药物开发，但未明确临床阶段转换计划。vHOT数据尚无独立第三方验证，且未公布具体中和抗体滴度或病毒载量变化数据。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-14T02:53:39.359Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"PepGen Inc. (PEPG) 介绍 FREEDOM2 最低剂量组安全性和剪接结果","latestReport":{"id":"bpbbbmg3y76cizgeht8eh25py"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fJ96sRp3A1yk","title":"PepGen Inc. 发布 FREEDOM2 最低剂量组安全、剪接和 vHOT 结果的幻灯片","firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T23:43:33.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"bpbbbmg3y76cizgeht8eh25py","title":"PepGen Inc. (PEPG) 介绍 FREEDOM2 最低剂量组安全性和剪接结果","summary":"PepGen Inc. (PEPG) 发布了 FREEDOM2 临床试验中最低剂量组的安全性、剪接和 vHOT 结果的幻灯片。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T23:43:33.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"bpbbbmg3y76cizgeht8eh25py","title":"PepGen Inc. (PEPG) 介绍 FREEDOM2 最低剂量组安全性和剪接结果","summary":"PepGen Inc. (PEPG) 发布了 FREEDOM2 临床试验中最低剂量组的安全性、剪接和 vHOT 结果的幻灯片。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T23:43:33.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T02:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T03:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T04:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T06:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T07:0